  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Raj Aggarwal, PhD, CFA Raj Aggarwal, PhD, CFA is a distinguished academic, executive, and board member with extensive experience and global recognition. He is an active civic leader. He holds a mechanical engineering degree from the Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi, an MBA and PhD in Business from Kent State University, and the Chartered Financial Analyst (CFA) designation. A graduate of Leadership Cleveland (2004), Raj has been honored with awards like the Notable Finance Leader and a Notable Immigrant Leader Awards by Crain’s and the..."
